# Coding Agent Rules — VFPScanner Web

## Frontend (Next.js 16 / React 19)

- Next.js 16 has breaking changes — read `frontend/node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using an API you are unsure of
- App Router; Server Components by default; Client Components only for interactivity and motion
- Static by default (`generateStaticParams`, no per-request data on marketing pages)
- TypeScript strict; Zod for every form, route-handler input and external API response
- Tailwind CSS 4 via `@theme` in `globals.css`; shadcn/ui primitives in `components/ui/`
- Vercel deploy — do NOT set `output: 'standalone'`

## Route handlers (`app/api/*`)

- Thin handler → `lib/` service → provider (Supabase, payments, email, Claude)
- Validate input with Zod, rate-limit, return typed JSON errors
- Payment webhooks: verify signature, idempotent on event id

## Content

- Page copy lives in `frontend/content/*.mdx` — never hardcode long copy in components
- Prices only from `lib/pricing.ts` (mirrors `docs/PRICING.md`)

## Verification Gate

```bash
cd frontend && npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm run test && npm run build
```

